  "contentHtml": "<div><div style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\" class=\"txc-textbox\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다. </span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요. </span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p><br>별의 일주운동을 반구와 음료수뚜껑을 이용하여 설명해봤어요~^^</p><p><iframe id=\"vd640wtwWVUWMbztYccczZU\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vd640wtwWVUWMbztYccczZU?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZkNjQwd3R3V1ZVV01ienRZY2NjelpVIiwidGlkIjoiYzA2NmYyMjItNmUwNC00MTcyLTk3NGMtM2ZkMGQ1Y2JkYWQ5IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NTkzfQ.uVAdD4ND2HabnQ5zLJ1UnZ6pZ2W3ivd60zzvH9rQ1HulGxhkXUr2lHorlXyfwPlgBefhtw0hE7ZkXx3v4cLtiw&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p><iframe id=\"vf874v5vL5YPzmzuOggvDML\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/vf874v5vL5YPzmzuOggvDML?service=daum_cafe&f=p&ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InZmODc0djV2TDVZUHptenVPZ2d2RE1MIiwidGlkIjoiZTVlZWY5NmYtODU0MC00Njc5LWFjY2EtYTAxOTE2NDg2ZTg1IiwiYXBwX2lkIjoiZGF1bV9jYWZlIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2MTg1NTkzfQ.lb-JjYaWxvpS0MUx2McLNNqq6wLJQG3GRBOXqz_6W8WwdxSXKCc6DzIyVJoHT8dFNi773sAsyyORO_OtTBs63A&autoplay=0\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
